  "solution": {
    "text": "Interionic/intermolecular forces <math><mo>&#8733;</mo></math> charge present on species<br />As ions are charged while dipole is only partially charged so the relative strength of interionic/intermolecular forces in decreasing order is:<br />Ion-Ion <math><mo>&#62;</mo></math>&nbsp;Ion-Dipole <math><mo>&#62;</mo></math>&nbsp;Dipole-Dipole"
